## 思路

按层模拟:维护四边界 `top/bottom/left/right`,按上→右→下→左顺序填数,每完成一边收缩边界,直到填满 `n²`。

## 参考代码

```js
function generateMatrix(n) {
  const res = Array.from({ length: n }, () => new Array(n).fill(0));
  let top = 0;
  let bottom = n - 1;
  let left = 0;
  let right = n - 1;
  let num = 1;
  while (num <= n * n) {
    for (let j = left; j <= right; j++) res[top][j] = num++;
    top++;
    for (let i = top; i <= bottom; i++) res[i][right] = num++;
    right--;
    for (let j = right; j >= left; j--) res[bottom][j] = num++;
    bottom--;
    for (let i = bottom; i >= top; i--) res[i][left] = num++;
    left++;
  }
  return res;
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(n²)
- 空间:O(n²)(输出)
